        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-QUADRINGENTENNIAL.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-QUADRING-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH396-QUADRING-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH397-HARDWARE-COHES-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH398-CROSS-LAYER-TK-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH399-HOGAN-SOLVENCY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH400-GRAND-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-QUADRING-WIT        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-QUADRING.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-QUADRING.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH396-QUADRING-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH397-HARDWARE-COHES-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH398-CROSS-LAYER-TK-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH399-HOGAN-SOLVENCY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH400-GRAND-SEAL-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-QUADRING-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-QUADRING-WIT.
